cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Five-Step Multi-Dimensional Learnability Validation Protocol"
abstract: >
  Reference implementation of a five-step protocol that determines, before
  model development begins, whether a clinical prediction target is learnable
  from the available features, and whether a model fitted to it is fit to
  deploy.
